# reaching the frame realm's observer. Disarm check: with the frame
# queueing disabled, leg 6 times out (5/6). JS-mutation stays 7/7.
#
# Not changed (recorded): innerHTML / textContent setters queue no
# childList records (realm or frame handle), as before; takeRecords()
# still returns [] and records are still matched against observers at
# delivery, not at queue time.
